  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Legendary low-top AF1 sneaker silhouette\nGenuine leather upper\nLow-top, cushioned collar delivers premium comfort and style\nMulti-tonal color-blocking for a distinctive look\nRope-chain-inspired 3D-embossed mini Swoosh charm on heel counter\nFull-length Nike Air unit provides shock absorption and lasting comfort\nPerforated toebox enhances ventilation\nTonal lace closure and lace charm secures the fit\nDurable rubber outsole with classic pivot circle pattern delivers reliable traction and a classic look\nThe Nike Air Force 1 '07  is imported.\nGlam up your selection of \"going out\" shoes with a pair of the Women's Nike Air Force 1 '07 Casual Shoes. Crafted with a genuine leather upper, this exclusive edition of the AF1 features muted, multi-tonal blocking and rope-chain-inspired 3D-embossed mini Swooshes on the heel counters for classy, contemporary charm.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Air Force 1 '07 Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Pure Violet</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3337978</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n<